# The app's web build IS committed — a deploy host runs `next build` and has no
# Flutter SDK, so generating it at deploy time would 404 /app for every fork.
# CanvasKit is excluded by scripts/build-app.sh because Flutter loads it from a
# CDN; that is what keeps the committed build under 4 MB instead of 40.
